## Changes

CreateBoard uses the existing Radix-backed Dialog primitives. App keeps modal visibility separate from Board/settings navigation. Empty Projects open it once and retain an explicit creation action. Form values reset on reopening. The API and default Stages are unchanged. Pending requests synchronously guard repeated submission, block Escape/outside dismissal, disable inputs and Cancel, and hide the close control. Errors are local role=alert messages that retain entered values. Success selects the returned Board id with existing session updates.

Updated CONTEXT.md and core spec. Added an isolated HTTP regression test for uninitialized Project creation, default Stages, duplicate Name and Key rejection without extra Boards, and successful retry.

